 "about": {
  "zh": [
   "這是合成示範案例：兩支球隊、所有球員、事件與位置都是虛構的，不來自任何真實比賽、轉播或追蹤資料。",
   "資料流程：產生器建立合成事件與每 0.5 秒的位置，並模擬轉播鏡頭只看得到球附近的範圍；流程讀入資料（ingest），依事件規則切出 3 個階段並計算可觀察特徵（interpret），再產生雙語解說（explain），輸出成播放器使用的案例格式（render）。播放器提供白話／戰術兩種深度、中英文與球員聚焦（personalize）。",
   "本案例的解說由離線規則範本產生，沒有呼叫任何 AI 模型。",
   "鏡頭外的球員位置為未知，不會被補成估計值。防守者與跑動者同時移動時，只描述為同時發生，不宣稱因果。"
  ],
  "en": [
   "This is a synthetic demo case: both teams, every player, the events and the positions are fictional and do not come from any real match, broadcast or tracking feed.",
   "Pipeline: a generator creates synthetic events and positions every 0.5 s, with a simulated broadcast camera that only sees the area around the ball. The pipeline ingests the data, segments it into 3 stages with event rules and computes observable features (interpret), writes bilingual explanations (explain) and outputs the player’s case format (render). The player offers simple/tactical depth, Chinese/English and player focus (personalize).",
   "The explanations in this case come from offline rule templates. No AI model was called.",
   "Players outside the camera view have unknown positions and are never filled in with estimates. When a defender moves with a runner, the replay says the movements happened together and does not claim cause."
  ]
 },
